{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed one-button platformer where precise timing is everything. Switch gravity through intricately designed levels that will put your reflexes to the test.  Includes single player story mode and competitive local multiplayer for up to <strong>8 players</strong>. Easily create and publish your own levels using the built-in editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/4dddcb80770228b10dff6a650bbe1e9b.poster.avif?t=1767141664\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/4dddcb80770228b10dff6a650bbe1e9b.webm?t=1767141664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/4dddcb80770228b10dff6a650bbe1e9b.mp4?t=1767141664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging single-player <strong>story mode</strong> with 8 levels, including a climactic boss encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative and varied level design, with new gameplay features introduced along the way, keeps the experience engaging throughout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive local multiplayer mode for up to <strong>8 players</strong>\u00a0\u2014 lots of chaotic fun for everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and share your own levels in the intuitive <strong>level editor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thousands</strong> of single-player and multiplayer user levels to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad, keyboard and mouse</strong> support \u2014 several players can share a keyboard and/or gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless profile creation with Steam login, with optional linking to an existing G-Switch account</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/7b6b5a3a7a01114d0d002e5e73ef84d7.poster.avif?t=1767141664\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/7b6b5a3a7a01114d0d002e5e73ef84d7.webm?t=1767141664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505960/extras/7b6b5a3a7a01114d0d002e5e73ef84d7.mp4?t=1767141664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Creator's First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505960/6abf443ade7d1febfea25299b832cc98be7c0223.jpg"},{"name":"First Switches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505960/fb22758a456419f65996224e80c216b2eab4782c.jpg"},{"name":"System Override","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505960/1f3267ddc657e33b840a189341463f8d791f4360.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505960/27c5a0c73059633b6f930dbcbb9ffa35954ce6f5.jpg"},{"name":"Orb Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505960/3eaaf947107df88f16bf59f0e29c820095e854d0.jpg"},{"name":"Final Sequence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505960/1b8cca7d8fc49509b74fca1d163f9f75c437b55b.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505960/4e1a7cde42f6b5bdfd6d830f4a3580c87118a82f.jpg"},{"name":"XP Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam